    "q-182674": {
      "dom_id": "step-q182674",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Find the missing values in the following truth table:\n\n| $\\,C\\,$ | $\\,D\\,$ | $\\,¬C⇒(¬C∨D)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-4}} |",
      "worked_solution": "First, we add columns for $¬C$ and $¬C∨D:$\n\n| $\\,C\\,$ | $\\,D\\,$ | $\\,¬C\\,$ | $\\,¬C∨D\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n\nNow, we add a column for $¬C⇒(¬C∨D).$ This statement is true unless $¬C$ is true and $¬C∨D$ is false.\n\n| $\\,C\\,$ | $\\,D\\,$ | $\\,¬C\\,$ | $\\,¬C∨D\\,$ | $\\,¬C⇒(C∨D)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |",
